###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - The pretrained model is identified as SevenNet-0 trained on MPtrj ('dispersion interactions absent in the MPtrj dataset'), i.e. the registry model 'SevenNet-0 trained on MPtrj' (the stub first written for loew2025), not the MPF-trained SevenNet-0 of park2024. The paper also quotes MAEs of 0.011 eV/atom, 0.041 eV/A and 2.78 kbar for SevenNet-0, apparently on its own training data; the sentence was cut in the text read and they are not encoded.
# - The fine-tuned model starts from the registry model; schema 0.1.2 cannot express that. Energy in eV/atom and stress in kbar have no unit individuals (mlips:hasUnit omitted). The run uses 600 scheduled epochs; the reported checkpoint is after 50 epochs.
# - Liquid densities, solvation-shell structures, diffusivities, conductivities and viscosities are the paper's results and have no MetricProperty.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).

